{"3882540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HavenFlower: Regrets Of", "steam_appid": 3882540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to immerse yourself in the unforgiving world of <strong>HavenFlower: Regrets Of,</strong> a fantasy/sci-fi RPG inspired by the PS2 era. The story centers around <strong>Loup,</strong> a charming baker android seeking vengeance against the merciless army that decimated their bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HavenFlower</strong> draws inspiration from various mecha-related anime and games. It blends a dark, gritty atmosphere with a fusion of fantasy and military technology. In this universe, the presence of a magical resource called pollen, harvested from celestial flowers, has empowered humans to construct formidable combat androids known as 'stamen'. These mechanized soldiers can transform into powerful armors known as 'pistils', which wield devastating offensive spells called Gheiz. The demo offers approximately 30-40 minutes of gameplay, featuring a hidden area and two formidable bosses to challenge your skills.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to immerse yourself in the unforgiving world of <strong>HavenFlower: Regrets Of,</strong> a fantasy/sci-fi RPG inspired by the PS2 era. The story centers around <strong>Loup,</strong> a charming baker android seeking vengeance against the merciless army that decimated their bakery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HavenFlower</strong> draws inspiration from various mecha-related anime and games. It blends a dark, gritty atmosphere with a fusion of fantasy and military technology. In this universe, the presence of a magical resource called pollen, harvested from celestial flowers, has empowered humans to construct formidable combat androids known as 'stamen'. These mechanized soldier